al Tools and accessories","Following Personal Hygiene and Workplace Safety Standards"]},{"heading":"Homecare Products","topics":["Recommended Skin Care and makeup maintenance Products for Clients","Guidance on Post-Makeup Care and Product Usage at Home"]}]'::jsonb, 60, true),
